From 1c1ec8ec09548707bed684c471bed7ece63ab1bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wu1ff <197699991+wu1ff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 17:16:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 0005-xpu-ops-gdn-index64-hook

P6 (python half) route gdn_attention to the int64-offset kernel library

Purpose:  Load vllm_xpu_kernels/libgdn_index64.so at import and call torch.ops._gdn_index64.gdn_attention instead
          of torch.ops._xpu_C.gdn_attention. The library is the vllm-xpu-kernels v0.1.14 GDN op rebuilt with
          64-bit conv-state offsets (source fix: ../vllm-xpu-kernels/0001-gdn-causal-conv1d-int64-state-offset.patch).
Depends:  the binary vllm_xpu_kernels/libgdn_index64.so (sha256 0fc700d337b71dfd6f2d4d08ca8ec588a26fc1bd669ed9034c6e4e468a804b75)
          MUST be present before vllm is imported, or import fails. The Dockerfile copies it from the wu1ff image.
Base:     vLLM v0.30.0 (tag commit ced6857afa0ea7b2e3f0846a62e1394e90f15607), as installed in
          docker.io/vllm/vllm-openai-xpu:v0.30.0 (amd64 sha256:e4446310b1d30015e8fdc1a0a2ef1669ac6bef857cbe772487571ed5c1a926a9).
          The installed site-packages files and /workspace/vllm source copies are byte-identical to the tag
          (checked 2026-09-28, base layers sha256:8439dd1b... and sha256:8fcb7387...).
Origin:   wu1ff B70-LLM-Controller pack Qwen3.8-Flash-Next 1.0.0/1.0.1 (MIT), image
          ghcr.io/wu1ff/qwen38-flashnext-b70@sha256:85512b52c09fa660a2e7fe441417129e7c47fac727fd85f66ccea6b65e0a9122 (amd64 sha256:761f215485ab9da27816366c65222465ba6dbf8acb2000641774ed698ce589f8)
Method:   re-derived as a unified diff from wu1ff's whole-file overlay (their overlay minus upstream v0.30.0).
          Applying this patch to v0.30.0 reproduces wu1ff's file byte-for-byte; the Dockerfile asserts the sha256.
Apply:    patch -p1 --fuzz=0 from the directory that CONTAINS vllm/ (site-packages AND /workspace/vllm).
Files (wu1ff image layer digests, site-packages / workspace copy):
  vllm/_xpu_ops.py <- layer sha256:69b3dc934a8b780c68e0ad5b305720851704c839147d2c5605f010706abfc0d0 / sha256:28c5b22d2e7e62d968f3ca09728364d68c8c571de41b8ed6f633b32aa05b6ca3
---
 vllm/_xpu_ops.py | 8 +++++++-
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/vllm/_xpu_ops.py b/vllm/_xpu_ops.py
index c1f2bb6..ae2d471 100644
--- a/vllm/_xpu_ops.py
+++ b/vllm/_xpu_ops.py
@@ -13,6 +13,12 @@ from vllm.platforms import current_platform
 from vllm.triton_utils import tl, triton
 from vllm.utils.torch_utils import direct_register_custom_op
 
+# GDN convolution uses 64-bit products for page-strided state tensors.
+from pathlib import Path
+import vllm_xpu_kernels
+
+torch.ops.load_library(str(Path(vllm_xpu_kernels.__file__).with_name("libgdn_index64.so")))
+
 logger = init_logger(__name__)
 
 if TYPE_CHECKING:
@@ -189,7 +195,7 @@ def _gdn_attention_core_xpu_impl(
         self.conv1d.weight.size(0), self.conv1d.weight.size(2)
     )
 
-    torch.ops._xpu_C.gdn_attention(
+    torch.ops._gdn_index64.gdn_attention(
         core_attn_out,
         z,
         projected_states_qkvz,
